# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EgoCITE — everything the pipeline generates or downloads stays out of git.
# Only source, prompts, config, and docs are tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Large regenerable intermediates (captions, sync files, memory DAGs, FAISS
# indices) stay out — rebuilt by src/scripts/1..3, see README. The run logs
# and results behind the reported numbers ARE committed.
output/*
!output/logs/
!output/results/

# Datasets are fetched by src/scripts/0-download.sh (HuggingFace) or cloned
# (LifeDialBench). Keep the folder and its README, never the data — with one
# exception: dataset/egomem/EgoMem-Normalized.json is DERIVED, not released
# data (see src/preprocess/normalize_egomem.py), and the harness cannot run
# without it, so it ships here. It cannot live at its runtime path
# dataset/LifeDialBench/data/ because that clone carries its own .git and git
# will not track files inside a nested repository.
dataset/*
!dataset/README.md
!dataset/egomem/

# Local credentials and endpoints. src/config.py reads these from the
# environment; never commit a filled-in copy.
.env
.env.*
*.key
secrets.*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Model / index artifacts, wherever they land (FAISS caches, model weights)
*.faiss
*.index
*.npy
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors

# Run detritus. Logs under a logs/ directory are deliberate artifacts and stay.
nohup.out
*.log
!**/logs/**/*.log
*.out
core.*

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
